            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# 0.36.10

- Count only agent sessions in Active and All. Open shell terminals are counted separately under Terminals, matching the agent activity summary.
- Describe navigation counts as sessions for accessibility.

Corresponding source, including pinned Swift package dependency sources and build scripts, is provided in `RunHuddle-0.36.10-source.tar.gz` alongside this installer. See docs/BUILDING.md and docs/LICENSING.md in that archive.
]]></description>
